eldpc verification reference decoder
====================================

This directory is a self-contained build of the reference decoder the verification suite compares
against. It contains:

- ldpc/src_cpp/*.hpp and ldpc/include/robin_map: the header-only C++ core of ldpc
  2.4.1, upstream https://github.com/quantumgizmos/ldpc, commit
  d3429964cd4ffe1abfc041c6ec8b8425cb174f40 (v2.4.1 era, 2025-12-08), MIT licence (see LICENSE).
  The changes of ldpc-2.4.1-decoder-bench.patch are applied to these headers: an explicit total
  order for the OSD column sort (soft value ascending, ties by ascending column index, NaN after
  every number) and for the LSD candidate orders, plus a fixed shuffle seed, so post-processing is
  reproducible. BP itself is unchanged. Comments in the patched headers and in the patch that
  point to documents of the decoder's development tree refer to files that are not part of this
  package.
  The robin_map headers carry their own MIT licence text. Upstream's include/rapidcsv (a CSV
  reader used only by upstream's C++ unit tests) is intentionally not vendored: the decoder
  headers do not use it.
- include/decoder_abi.h: the decoder ABI v1 header.
- ldpc_ref_abi.cpp, ldpc_ref_build_info.hpp.in, CMakeLists.txt: the C ABI shim and build of this
  package.

The patched headers produce the same decoder outputs as the reference construction's reference
library at the same settings (the patch file is the reference construction's reference patch, SHA-256
f451d4cd8ce992242460bf12e745bb8b5bb5f0c4f3b415792109ba9b78f42d9c).
